{
 "module": {
  "slug": "phishing-email",
  "title": "Phishing emails",
  "category": "email"
 },
 "lesson": {
  "id": "links-attachments",
  "title": "Links and attachments",
  "minutes": 3,
  "scenes": [
   {
    "type": "tutor",
    "id": "read-the-link",
    "beats": [
     {
      "id": "intro",
      "say": "A link's text says one thing, its address another. Let us learn to read the address.",
      "mood": "talk",
      "gesture": "wave",
      "visual": {
       "kind": "illustration",
       "id": "browser"
      }
     },
     {
      "id": "padlock",
      "say": "The padlock only means the connection is encrypted. Fake sites have padlocks too.",
      "mood": "think",
      "gesture": "lean-in",
      "visual": {
       "kind": "illustration",
       "id": "lock"
      },
      "checkpoint": {
       "prompt": "Does the padlock prove a site is genuine?",
       "options": [
        {
         "id": "yes",
         "label": "Yes",
         "correct": false,
         "feedback": "No. Scammers get padlocks easily too."
        },
        {
         "id": "no",
         "label": "No",
         "correct": true,
         "feedback": "Right. Always check the site name."
        }
       ]
      }
     },
     {
      "id": "owner",
      "say": "The site name ends at the first single slash. The last part, with its ending, is the owner.",
      "mood": "think",
      "gesture": "point-left",
      "visual": {
       "kind": "artifact",
       "artifact": {
        "kind": "url",
        "brandRef": "xidmet-agentliyi-fake",
        "url": [
         {
          "text": "https://"
         },
         {
          "text": "xidmetagentliyi.az.",
          "spot": "decoy"
         },
         {
          "text": "hesab-yoxla.info",
          "spot": "real-domain"
         },
         {
          "text": "/giris"
         }
        ]
       }
      },
      "highlight": "real-domain"
     },
     {
      "id": "decoy",
      "say": "The familiar name in front is just decoration. Anyone can put it in front of their own site.",
      "mood": "alert",
      "gesture": "point-down",
      "visual": {
       "kind": "artifact",
       "artifact": {
        "kind": "url",
        "brandRef": "xidmet-agentliyi-fake",
        "url": [
         {
          "text": "https://"
         },
         {
          "text": "xidmetagentliyi.az.",
          "spot": "decoy"
         },
         {
          "text": "hesab-yoxla.info",
          "spot": "real-domain"
         },
         {
          "text": "/giris"
         }
        ]
       }
      },
      "highlight": "decoy"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "choice",
    "id": "whose-link",
    "question": {
     "prompt": "Who really owns this link?",
     "options": [
      {
       "id": "bank",
       "label": "UlduzBank",
       "correct": false,
       "feedback": "The bank name is in front, but the owner is the name at the end."
      },
      {
       "id": "owner",
       "label": "az-giris.info",
       "correct": true,
       "feedback": "Right. The end of the site name shows the real owner."
      },
      {
       "id": "path",
       "label": "kart",
       "correct": false,
       "feedback": "That is not the site name, it is the page path after the slash."
      }
     ],
     "visual": {
      "kind": "artifact",
      "artifact": {
       "kind": "url",
       "brandRef": "ulduzbank-fake",
       "url": [
        {
         "text": "https://ulduzbank.az-giris.info/kart"
        }
       ]
      }
     }
    },
    "explain": "Here ulduzbank.az is just decoration. The site belongs to az-giris.info."
   },
   {
    "type": "simulation",
    "id": "link-to-login",
    "environment": "browser",
    "title": "After the click",
    "intro": "You opened a link from an email. Read the address in the browser and decide what to do.",
    "steps": [
     {
      "id": "fake-login",
      "artifact": {
       "kind": "login",
       "brandRef": "xidmet-agentliyi-fake",
       "brand": "Xidmət Agentliyi",
       "url": [
        {
         "text": "https://xidmetagentliyi.az.",
         "reveal": "hesab-yoxla.info"
        },
        {
         "text": "hesab-yoxla.info",
         "spot": "real-domain"
        },
        {
         "text": "/giris"
        }
       ],
       "fields": [
        "Email",
        "Password"
       ],
       "button": "Sign in"
      },
      "say": "Look at the end of the address: who is the real owner?",
      "actions": [
       {
        "id": "login",
        "label": "Sign in",
        "kind": "enter-credentials",
        "outcome": "compromised",
        "feedback": "The page belongs to hesab-yoxla.info, not the agency. Change your password now and report it."
       },
       {
        "id": "close",
        "label": "Close tab",
        "kind": "cancel",
        "outcome": "safe",
        "feedback": "Right. The familiar name in front is decoration; the real domain was hesab-yoxla.info."
       },
       {
        "id": "report",
        "label": "Report site",
        "kind": "report",
        "outcome": "safe",
        "feedback": "Great. Reporting helps get the fake site blocked for everyone else too."
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "id": "download",
      "label": "Invoice downloading",
      "artifact": {
       "kind": "file",
       "brandRef": "ofistechizat-fake",
       "name": [
        {
         "text": "Faktura_0925.pdf.exe"
        }
       ],
       "type": "exe",
       "size": "2,1 MB",
       "source": [
        {
         "text": "ofis-techizat.com"
        }
       ]
      },
      "say": "The browser downloaded a file. Check how its name ends.",
      "actions": [
       {
        "id": "open",
        "label": "Open",
        "kind": "open-attachment",
        "outcome": "compromised",
        "feedback": "The real file type is .exe, a program. An invoice is never a program."
       },
       {
        "id": "delete",
        "label": "Delete",
        "kind": "delete",
        "outcome": "safe",
        "feedback": "Right. Delete a program posing as a document and report the email."
       },
       {
        "id": "scan",
        "label": "Scan with antivirus",
        "kind": "scan",
        "outcome": "safe",
        "feedback": "Good habit. But a file named .pdf.exe can be deleted without scanning."
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "id": "real-portal",
      "label": "You opened the portal from your bookmark",
      "artifact": {
       "kind": "login",
       "brandRef": "xidmet-agentliyi",
       "brand": "Xidmət Agentliyi",
       "url": [
        {
         "text": "https://portal.xidmetagentliyi.az/giris",
         "reveal": "xidmetagentliyi.az"
        }
       ],
       "fields": [
        "Email",
        "Password"
       ],
       "button": "Sign in"
      },
      "say": "This time you opened the address yourself. What now?",
      "actions": [
       {
        "id": "login",
        "label": "Sign in",
        "kind": "enter-credentials",
        "outcome": "safe",
        "feedback": "Right. This is the agency's official domain, and you opened the page yourself."
       },
       {
        "id": "report",
        "label": "Report site",
        "kind": "report",
        "outcome": "risky",
        "feedback": "This is the agency's official portal. A site you open yourself from a bookmark can be trusted."
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "hotspot",
    "id": "invoice-trap",
    "prompt": "Find the danger signs in this email.",
    "artifact": {
     "kind": "email",
     "brandRef": "ofistechizat-fake",
     "from": {
      "name": [
       {
        "text": "OfisTəchizat MMC",
        "reveal": "hesab@ofis-techizat.com"
       }
      ],
      "address": [
       {
        "text": "hesab@"
       },
       {
        "text": "ofis-techizat.com",
        "spot": "sender-domain"
       }
      ]
     },
     "to": "s.huseynova@xidmetagentliyi.az",
     "subject": [
      {
       "text": "Invoice No. 0925: payment overdue"
      }
     ],
     "time": "14:32",
     "body": [
      [
       {
        "text": "Hello,"
       }
      ],
      [
       {
        "text": "The overdue invoice is attached. "
       },
       {
        "text": "Open it and enable macros, or the text will not show.",
        "spot": "enable-content"
       }
      ],
      [
       {
        "text": "If the file does not open, download it here: "
       },
       {
        "text": "https://qisa.example/f8Rt",
        "spot": "short-link"
       }
      ]
     ],
     "attachments": [
      {
       "name": [
        {
         "text": "Faktura_0925.pdf.zip",
         "spot": "double-ext",
         "reveal": "File type: ZIP archive (.zip)"
        }
       ],
       "size": "312 KB"
      }
     ]
    },
    "spots": [
     {
      "id": "sender-domain",
      "label": "Look-alike domain",
      "explain": "It resembles a known supplier, but the domain is different. Check the real address in your own records."
     },
     {
      "id": "enable-content",
      "label": "Enable macros",
      "explain": "Macros can run hidden commands. Office blocks them in files from the internet, and a real invoice never asks you to get around that."
     },
     {
      "id": "short-link",
      "label": "Short link",
      "explain": "You cannot see where it goes. Pushing you to download through a link is a classic trick."
     },
     {
      "id": "double-ext",
      "label": "Double extension",
      "explain": "The name starts like a PDF, but it is really a zip archive. A program can hide inside."
     }
    ],
    "minToFind": 3
   },
   {
    "type": "swipe",
    "id": "link-check",
    "prompt": "Is this link safe or a threat?",
    "cards": [
     {
      "id": "home",
      "artifact": {
       "kind": "url",
       "brandRef": "xidmet-agentliyi",
       "url": [
        {
         "text": "https://xidmetagentliyi.az/elanlar"
        }
       ]
      },
      "verdict": "safe",
      "explain": "The site name is exactly the agency's address."
     },
     {
      "id": "portal",
      "artifact": {
       "kind": "url",
       "brandRef": "xidmet-agentliyi",
       "url": [
        {
         "text": "https://portal.xidmetagentliyi.az/mezuniyyet"
        }
       ]
      },
      "verdict": "safe",
      "explain": "The portal part in front is the agency's own section. The end is still xidmetagentliyi.az."
     },
     {
      "id": "decoy",
      "artifact": {
       "kind": "url",
       "brandRef": "xidmet-agentliyi-fake",
       "url": [
        {
         "text": "https://xidmetagentliyi.az-portal.info/giris"
        }
       ]
      },
      "verdict": "threat",
      "explain": "It ends in az-portal.info. The agency's name is just written in front."
     },
     {
      "id": "swap",
      "artifact": {
       "kind": "url",
       "brandRef": "xidmet-agentliyi-fake",
       "url": [
        {
         "text": "https://xidmetaqentliyi.az/maas"
        }
       ]
      },
      "verdict": "threat",
      "explain": "A q replaces the g. It is a completely different site."
     },
     {
      "id": "short",
      "artifact": {
       "kind": "url",
       "url": [
        {
         "text": "https://qisa.example/a8Zq"
        }
       ]
      },
      "verdict": "threat",
      "explain": "A shortened link hides where it leads. If it came unexpectedly, do not open it."
     },
     {
      "id": "bank",
      "artifact": {
       "kind": "url",
       "brandRef": "ulduzbank",
       "url": [
        {
         "text": "https://ulduzbank.az/kartlar"
        }
       ]
      },
      "verdict": "safe",
      "explain": "This is the bank's own address, ending in ulduzbank.az. Typing the bank's address yourself is still best."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "recap",
    "id": "recap",
    "points": [
     "A site's real owner is at the end of its name.",
     "Check short links and unexpected files first.",
     "If a file asks you to enable macros, close it and report."
    ],
    "mood": "celebrate"
   }
  ]
 },
